Package: govpn-client
Version: VERSION_PLACEHOLDER
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: ARCH_PLACEHOLDER
Maintainer: govpn <noreply@example.com>
Depends: systemd
Description: govpn mesh VPN client (WireGuard-based)
 Client agent for the govpn mesh VPN (a Tailscale-style overlay network
 built on WireGuard). Registers with a govpn-server coordination server,
 creates a WireGuard network interface and keeps it in sync with the
 rest of the mesh.
 .
 Configuration lives in /etc/govpn/config.yml after install — edit it
 with your server address and auth key, then:
   sudo systemctl start govpn-client
